hypotheses=['Uniform physical cube; all private X_j are mutually disjoint and disjoint from the one shared coordinate z.','Representation, z and widths are public before the spectral set is sampled; R is fixed for the whole spectral set.','Entropy and logarithmic code costs use base 2. Claims concern logarithmic cost with standard asymptotic arithmetic coding, not an uncharged integral prefix length.']
cid='A008-COMMON-ANCHOR-OVERLAP-OBSTRUCTION-AND-CORE-DICTIONARY-PAYMENT'
